driving from one side of the area to the other and then back again, often times with loading screens or transitional cut scenes in between. It feels like the game is going out of its way to waste your time.\n\nTLDR: In every aspect Mass Effect 4 feels like an inferior title to the previous Mass Effect entries. There is no reason to play this, outside of morbid curiosity.", "timestamp_created": 1612125989, "timestamp_updated": 1612125989, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.449430912733078003", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85715415", "author": {"steamid": "76561198373807439", "personaname": "Wraith-Racing", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198373807439/", "num_games_owned": 61, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 224, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 224, "last_played": 1612122960, "avatar": "da4f0245f3d01e885110df7d396f0467a8a6a7a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "wouldnt bother cant even get through 1 mission without a game crash or a bug its constant. played 3 hours and had to shut the game down at least 3/4 times a hour to just progress.", "timestamp_created": 1612123311, "timestamp_updated": 1612123311, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456431567668914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "85714647", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130168388", "personaname": "Peter King", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/peterkral/", "num_games_owned": 189, "num_reviews": 36, "