atar": "34be390824a0a4f3c1bb5697ce3eef6b9384015a"}, "language": "english", "review": "[h1][url= store.steampowered.com/curator/33249721/] Follow me - I'm a curator! [/url][/h1] \n\n[b]PROS:[/b] \n• combat is really solid and fun (at least on the highest difficulty setting) \n• crafting allows you to produce overpowered weapons and armor, as well useless hilarious junk. \n• satisfying ending \n• most of the crew is likable\n\n[b]CONS:[/b] \n• technical issues, but nothing major \n• terrible menus and interfaces, not user friendly or intuitive at all! \n• if you were to pick a female protagonist, your experience will be worse (her face still looks awkward)\n• audio gets cut off all the time or overlaps. They expect you to stay perfectly still while someone is talking. Don't open chests! Don't run! \n• scanning planets is pointless and the camera pan takes forever \n• some things in the plot don't make a lot of sense   \n\n[b]VERDICT:[/b] 8/10", "timestamp_created": 1612115191, "timestamp_updated": 1612115223, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.524064183235168457", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}]}